Orange Pi RV2 — experimental Alpine Linux (riscv64)

This image boots only when manufacturer OpenSBI and U-Boot are already in SPI flash.
It does not program SPI. U-Boot must load /extlinux/extlinux.conf.

Serial console: root / rv2-changeme
SSH root login is disabled. Change the root password before exposing the board.
Wi-Fi and Bluetooth are not functional. This image has not been verified on hardware.
